# Closing / quitting a running desktop application.
# Shares the open-vocabulary {application} slot with launch.intent and the same
# application.blacklist slot-value exclusion.
[please] (close|exit|kill|quit|terminate|shut down|shut off) {application}
[please] (close|exit|kill|quit|terminate) [the] (app|application|program|window) {application}
(can|could) you (close|exit|kill|quit|terminate|shut down|shut off) {application} [for me]
i (want|need) to (close|exit|kill|quit|terminate|shut down) {application}
shut {application} down
